.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH loom 1  "loom 1.0.0" 
.SH NAME
loom \- Loom command\-line interface
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBloom\fR [\fB\-\-config\fR] [\fB\-\-pretty\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Loom command\-line interface
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-config\fR \fI<CONFIG>\fR
Override config file path. Highest precedence after CLI flags
.TP
\fB\-\-pretty\fR
Pretty\-print output via the schema\-driven tabular renderer (IC\-CLI\-02). Default is canonical JSON (IC\-CLI\-01)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
loom\-session(1)
Session lifecycle commands (RPC)
.TP
loom\-action(1)
Action invocation (RPC)
.TP
loom\-vault(1)
Vault commands (RPC). Only `add` may prompt (IC\-CLI\-10)
.TP
loom\-gc(1)
Garbage collection (RPC)
.TP
loom\-serve(1)
Spawn the daemon. RPC\-free local action (IC\-CLI\-05)
.TP
loom\-postinstall(1)
Idempotent installer. RPC\-free local action (IC\-CLI\-06)
.TP
loom\-doctor(1)
Health checks. RPC\-free local action (IC\-CLI\-07)
.TP
loom\-mcp(1)
MCP delegation entry. RPC\-free; delegates to loom\-mcp (SR\-CLI\-02)
.TP
loom\-import(1)
Import external recordings as non\-replayable Loom sessions (RPC)
.TP
loom\-benchmark(1)
Run performance benchmarks and validate SLAs. RPC\-free local action
.TP
loom\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
.SH VERSION
v1.0.0
